msgstr "ສົ່ງອີເມວສະເພາະສິນຄ້າ ເມື່ອໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ"

#. module: product_email_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_email_template.field_product_product__email_template_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_email_template.field_product_template__email_template_id
msgid ""
"When validating an invoice, an email will be sent to the customer based on "
"this template. The customer will receive an email for each product linked to "
"an email template."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້, ອີເມວຈະຖືກສົ່ງຫາລູກຄ້າຕາມແມ່ແບບນີ້. ລູກຄ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບອີເມວສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສິນຄ້າ ທີ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂ"
"ຍງກັບແມ່ແບບອີເມວ."
